=== escaping quotation ===
PASS: an escaped quotation calls the helper after its frame popped
=== stored in a container ===
PASS: a stored quotation calls its helper
PASS: a second stored quotation calls its own helper
=== spawned task ===
PASS: a spawned task calls a helper whose frame popped
=== curry over a leaf ===
PASS: an escaped quotation calls a curried helper
=== cycle shape stays pinned ===
PASS: a curried helper over a container still works
=== word info and local scope ===
PASS: a kept word info array holds its body after the frame popped
PASS: a helper captured by local-scope outlives its frame
=== tail call out of a frame ===
PASS: a word tail calling out of a defining frame
escape
